Show exits, port forwards, and which networks use what

Usage:
  olr gateway show [flags]
  olr gateway show [command]

Available Commands:
  exit        Show one exit in full
  exits       List the ways out of this box
  forward     Show one port forward in full
  forwards    List the ports being forwarded in
  traffic     Show how much each client has used, and through which way out

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr gateway show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
